# Hermes's live state (session history, memory, OAuth token, hand-tuned
# config) lives outside this repo entirely — bind-mounted from
# ../conductor-data/hermes, see docker-compose.yml. Nothing under that path
# is ever inside this working tree, so it can't be committed regardless of
# gitignore. These entries are defense-in-depth only, for the case someone
# copies one of these files into the repo for local debugging and forgets
# to remove it — real credentials, never meant to be committed.
google_token.json
google_client_secret.json
auth.json
